    "directions": [
      "In a large bowl, add eggs, salt to taste, degi red chili powder, turmeric powder, oil and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, pour prepared mixture and cook it well on low flame.",
      "Cover it with a lid or another pan and cook for 15-20 minutes.",
      "Transfer it to another pan, flip the egg mixture and cook it for 10-15 minutes on low flame.",
      "Transfer it to a plate and keep it aside to cool down at room temperature.",
      "In a handi, add oil & ghee, once it's hot, add bay leaf, green cardamom, onions and saute it until translucent.",
      "Add ginger garlic paste and cook for a while until golden brown.",
      "Add turmeric powder, coriander powder, degi red chili powder and saute for a minute.",
      "Add water and mix it well, add fresh tomato puree, salt to taste and cook it well.",
      "Add water to adjust the consistency, add salt to taste, sugar, fresh cream and stir it well.",
      "Add tender coriander stems, fried eggs & vegetables, butter and let it simmer for a while.",
      "Finish it with some roasted dry fenugreek leaves and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish or bowl, garnish it with fresh cream, roasted dry fenugreek leaves and coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti.",
      "In a bowl, add mustard oil, salt to taste, ginger garlic paste, turmeric powder, degi red chili powder, lemon juice, hung curd, prepared egg frittata, capsicum, tomato and toss it well.",
      "Keep it aside to marinate for further use.",
      "In a pan, add oil, once it's hot, add marinated eggs & vegetables and fry on both the sides until golden brown.",
      "Transfer it to a tray or plate and keep it aside for further use."
    ],
